# The Road to Aht Urhgan (jeuno 91): ENABLE_TOAU true: the Lua's xi.settings.main.ENABLE_TOAU == 1 is false for a boolean
# (Settings.MainEquals, quest rework P9; MainNumber / Main would read true as 1): not offered, Faursel's default 10065.
# Then 1: 10062 (Prog 0's offer). Recorded on Lua at d954561a^ (the parent of the commit that deleted the Lua).
lists LowerJeuno/Faursel/onTrigger
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=39.5,4.1,-45.2 job=WAR lvl=75
setting ENABLE_TOAU true
login
trigger Faursel                     # true is not 1: no section; 10065
finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 1
trigger Faursel                     # Prog 0: 10062
finish
